config WDT_WS9652A
	bool "WS9652A watchdog"
	default y
	depends on WATCHDOG
	depends on DT_HAS_ZGMICRO_WS9652A_WATCHDOG_ENABLED
	help
	  Disable the inherited watchdog using the recovered stock sequence.
	  Timeout installation, setup and feeding are not supported yet.
	  Initialization leaves hardware unchanged; peer and board lifecycle
	  code explicitly decide when to stop the watchdog.
